    "created_at": "2022-10-29T12:38:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-29T12:50:34Z",
    "body": "For me, adding `shell_integration disabled` to `kitty.conf` fixes the issue.\r\n\r\nLooking at Kitty's [integration script for bash](https://github.com/kovidgoyal/kitty/blob/master/shell-integration/bash/kitty.bash), it makes a whole range of changes to the prompt, which are likely responsible for breaking Starship in this case.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
